    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Song of Songs, which is Solomon’s."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Woman"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Oh, that he would kiss me with the kisses of his mouth!",
          "For your caresses are more delightful than wine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The fragrance of your perfume is intoxicating;",
          "your name is perfume poured out.",
          "No wonder young women adore you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Take me with you #— #let’s hurry.",
          "Oh, that the king would bring me to his chambers."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Young Women"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We will rejoice and be glad in you;",
          "we will celebrate your caresses more than wine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Woman"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It is only right that they adore you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Daughters of Jerusalem,",
          "I am dark like the tents of Kedar,",
          "yet lovely like the curtains of Solomon."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not stare at me because I am dark,",
          "for the sun has gazed on me.",
          "My mother’s sons were angry with me;",
          "they made me take care of the vineyards.",
          "I have not taken care of my own vineyard."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Tell me, you whom I love:",
          "Where do you pasture your sheep?",
          "Where do you let them rest at noon?",
          "Why should I be like one who veils herself",
          "beside the flocks of your companions?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Man"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If you do not know,",
          "most beautiful of women,",
          "follow the tracks of the flock,",
          "and pasture your young goats",
          "near the shepherds’ tents."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I compare you, my darling,",
          "to a mare among Pharaoh’s chariots."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your cheeks are beautiful with jewelry,",
          "your neck with its necklace."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We will make gold jewelry for you,",
          "accented with silver."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Woman"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "While the king is on his couch,",
          "my perfume releases its fragrance."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one I love is a sachet of myrrh to me,",
          "spending the night between my breasts."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one I love is a cluster of henna blossoms to me,",
          "in the vineyards of En-gedi."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Man"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How beautiful you are, my darling.",
          "How very beautiful!",
          "Your eyes are doves."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Woman"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How handsome you are, my love.",
          "How delightful!",
          "Our bed is verdant;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the beams of our house are cedars,",
          "and our rafters are cypresses."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
